From: Andrew Mello <andrew@88plug.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 21:00:00 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] istio: keep a newer Gateway API install (release-1.2)

The istio role applies Gateway API v1.2.1's standard-install.yaml over whatever
the cluster has. k3s v1.37 bundles the Gateway API CRDs itself (its
gateway-api-crd addon, manifests/gateway-api-crd.yaml at v1.37.1+k3s1), and
Gateway API v1.5.0 and later ship the safe-upgrades.gateway.networking.k8s.io
ValidatingAdmissionPolicy, which refuses to install a lower version:

  customresourcedefinitions.apiextensions.k8s.io
  "gatewayclasses.gateway.networking.k8s.io" is forbidden: ValidatingAdmissionPolicy
  'safe-upgrades.gateway.networking.k8s.io' ... denied request: Installing CRDs
  with version before v1.5.0 is prohibited by default.

so `install agent-toolkit` (and `install inference`) stops at
"istio | Install Gateway API CRDs" on every k3s v1.37 cluster. EAS main's
gateway role already keeps newer Gateway API CRDs another tool installed
(EAS #42, roles/envoy_gateway/tasks/crds.yaml); this does the same in
release-1.2's istio role: the CRDs are applied only when gatewayclasses is
absent or its gateway.networking.k8s.io/bundle-version is lower than
istio_gateway_api_crds_version. Istio uses the v1 resources both serve.
---
--- a/roles/istio/tasks/install.yaml
+++ b/roles/istio/tasks/install.yaml
@@ -67,10 +67,26 @@
       ansible.builtin.include_tasks: install_csr.yaml
       when: istio_enabled | default(true) | bool
 
+    # A newer Gateway API install another tool owns stays: k3s v1.37 bundles the CRDs
+    # (its gateway-api-crd addon), and from Gateway API v1.5.0 their safe-upgrades
+    # ValidatingAdmissionPolicy refuses a lower version. Istio reads the v1 resources
+    # either serves, as main's gateway role keeps newer foreign CRDs (EAS #42).
+    - name: "istio | Read the installed Gateway API version"
+      kubernetes.core.k8s_info:
+        api_version: apiextensions.k8s.io/v1
+        kind: CustomResourceDefinition
+        name: gatewayclasses.gateway.networking.k8s.io
+      register: _istio_gateway_api_crd
+
     - name: "istio | Install Gateway API CRDs"
       kubernetes.core.k8s:
         state: present
         src: "{{ istio_gateway_api_crds_url }}"
+      when: >-
+        (_istio_gateway_api_crd.resources | default([]) | length == 0)
+        or ((_istio_gateway_api_crd.resources[0].metadata.annotations | default({}, true))
+            ['gateway.networking.k8s.io/bundle-version'] | default('v0.0.0', true) | regex_replace('^v', ''))
+           is version(istio_gateway_api_crds_version | regex_replace('^v', ''), '<')
 
     - name: "istio | Install Helm chart"
       kubernetes.core.helm:
